# Autoconf site defaults for cross-compiling TeX Live for RISC OS
# (arm-unknown-riscos, GCCSDK with UnixLib).
#
# configure cannot run test programs when cross-compiling, so tests that need
# to run one either guess pessimistically or stop. Answers go here, one per
# test, each with the reason and where the answer came from, so they can be
# checked again when the toolchain or TeX Live changes.
#
# scripts/build-texlive.sh points CONFIG_SITE at this file. Only set a cache
# variable when a configure log shows the test needs an answer.

# (No entries yet: the first cross-configure run decides what is needed.)
